## Tips for Interview Preparation
- Practice writing code on paper or a whiteboard.
- Focus on understanding memory management and pointers.
- Be prepared to explain your code and thought process.
- Use examples from past projects to demonstrate your skills.

Good luck with your interview! 🚀
